1
00:00:03,753 --> 00:00:07,173
(Howard:)Completely empty box,
if you'd like to examine it.

2
00:00:07,340 --> 00:00:08,380
(Leonard:)Mm-hm.

3
00:00:08,550 --> 00:00:12,720
(Leonard:)Yep. I see nothing in this box
but a wasted childhood.

4
00:00:13,722 --> 00:00:15,762
(Howard:)Little snarky there, cello lessons.

5
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:23,020
(Howard:)We have this completely ordinary
cylinder if you'd like to examine it.

6
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:28,320
(Raj:)Ordinary, yet I sense it
is dripping with magical potential.

7
00:00:29,112 --> 00:00:30,862
(Sheldon:)Oh, dear Lord.

8
00:00:31,072 --> 00:00:34,492
(Sheldon:)A man pops out for a moment
to evacuate his bowels...

9
00:00:34,659 --> 00:00:38,159
(Sheldon:)...and catch up on the adventures
of the Caped Crusader only to emerge...

10
00:00:38,329 --> 00:00:42,499
(Sheldon:)...and discover his apartment has been
transformed into a cabaret.

11
00:00:43,334 --> 00:00:46,044
Sheldon, he's practicing
for his cousin's birthday party.

12
00:00:46,254 --> 00:00:50,424
(Howard:)As I was saying,
empty box, empty cylinder, and...

13
00:00:50,592 --> 00:00:51,802
(Sheldon:)Ooh!

14
00:00:51,968 --> 00:00:53,468
Voilá.

15
00:00:53,887 --> 00:00:58,937
I'm telling you, there's a seat on the
Hogwart's Express with your name on it.

16
00:00:59,142 --> 00:01:02,642
(Sheldon:)This is how you're going to entertain
your little cousin and his friends?

